        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Design Hardware 1000 Series Exit Devices</b>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hand: Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li><b>Finish: Brushed Stainless Steel head and touchbar</b></li>\r\n<li>Chassis: Aluminum Chassis</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Roller strike standard</li>\r\n<li>Deadlocking Latchbolt: Standard</li>\r\n<li>Dogging: Hex Key Dogging</li>\r\n<li>Doors: 1 3/4\" thick wood or metal</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3 1/8\" Maximum</li>\r\n<li>ANSI: Certified ANSI A156.3 Grade 1 standards</li>\r\n<li>UL: UL Listed</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: All mounting screws are concealed</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Rod: Surface Vertical Rod also available</li>\r\n<li>Fire Rated: Fire rating also available</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 3 years</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWhen choosing the function of the lever / knob / trim:\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry: Use when a keyed lock is needed.</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Storeroom. Outside knob fixed. Entry by key only. Inside always unlocked. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nOn the TP08, the thumpiece is Brushed Stainless Steel. It also includes a 1-1/4\" mortise cylinder.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nUL 3-hour Fire Rating for A-Label Fire Doors (when chooosing this option below).\r\n</p>",
